#. module: ab_ai_agent
#: model:ai.agent.tool,description:ab_ai_agent.tool_record_action:0
msgid ""
"Finalize a business document the user names by its number: confirm a "
"Sale/Purchase Order, post an Invoice/Bill/Payment, or validate a Stock "
"Picking. Examples: \"INV/2026/00001 please post\", \"SO00047 confirm the "
"order\", \"WH/IN/00012 validate\", \"PBNK1/2026/0003 post payment\". Pass "
"the exact reference the user said. WRITE action — only runs when the agent "
"is allowed write actions; otherwise the user is told it's blocked."
msgstr ""

#. module: ab_ai_agent
#: model:ai.agent.tool,description:ab_ai_agent.tool_semantic_search:0
msgid ""
"Find records semantically similar to a natural-language query (vector cosine"
" search over pgvector). Use when the user references a record by paraphrase "
"(\"the deal with Acme construction\", \"leads that look like the one I "
"closed last week\", \"policies about overtime\") rather than an exact "
"identifier. The result is a pipe-CSV `id|name|score|hint1|hint2` — cite ids "
"in your answer, do not invent fields. model: technical model name (e.g. "
"'crm.lead', 'res.partner', 'ai.chat.fact'); query: the search text. Only "
"models that have been embedded return useful results — when count=0, fall "
"back to other tools."
msgstr ""

